    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but there is no one, kael. the people in this city... they're just as hollow as the streets. even the \"help\" is just another layer of the surveillance, another way to keep us plugged in and grinding away. there's no real way to find peace here. it's just a cycle that never ends.",
